---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What konaclaw.ai collects: an email address if you give one, and nothing else.">
  <article class="prose-kc pt-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-strong">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated 2026-09-19. This policy covers the website konaclaw.ai. The KonaClaw application will have its own notice when it ships.</p>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>If you enter your email address in the launch-notification form, that address is collected. Nothing else is. This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and loads no third-party scripts.</p>
    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To send you one email when KonaClaw is available to download, and occasional product news afterwards if you stay subscribed.</p>
    <h2>Who processes it</h2>
    <p>Buttondown (buttondown.com), an email newsletter service, stores the list and sends the email on our behalf. Buttondown asks you to confirm your address before you are added.</p>
    <h2>How to leave</h2>
    <p>Every email has an unsubscribe link. Unsubscribing deletes your address from the list. You can also write to the address in the site footer's terms page and ask for removal.</p>
    <h2>Server logs</h2>
    <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, which keeps standard, short-lived request logs (IP address, page requested, time) for security and to count visits. We do not export or analyze them per visitor.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the date above changes with it.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
